  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "这场逃亡跨越七十八天，五条生命在途中消逝。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "339c8393e629494537d79622b09e5b365f5cd54179c16784c306183dd45508f8",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.41
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "最终识破他的，竟是一名小学五年级的女孩。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "f27ebacb33acde56116835c338ed0e755d09218addf8d65bafff0d0de3b469ea",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.435
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九六三年十月十八日，福冈县两名男子遇害。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "d20015e2372e0771271334589596fc7ed9a9511fce1f8cfe749f7dd2c4f2bf10",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.516
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "警方根据目击证言等线索，很快锁定一名嫌疑人。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "78468226e3e0054b1e26d0d591a6f16ea6f6b9a837495f648f7b2e5573138d48",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.307
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "他叫西口彰，当时三十七岁，曾因诈骗和盗窃获罪。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "3900803f58bf857e2ddbd027261affa8d0d019cb8657534e7e58680d8ad84a17",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.921
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "福冈警方随即发出全国通缉，寻找他的踪迹。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "1cf23704dae196468a955d28adc56b7c93b0aeeb5407fbda7ba2ebe6c6cbeb72",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "逃亡途中，西口从报纸上得知，自己已被通缉。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "82fcb8376473a00da3773fd0b214b1d0fa1dea6da180be140c3d1f0030fdcd35",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.516
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "濑户内海的渡轮上，他留下一双鞋和一封信。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "53eae80ba0cc6c0d8346449cc57e46e5063b3489c5354405f8e0641156b91971",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.9
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "这场假死只是障眼法，他已经换了身份继续逃亡。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "610ab09210daad94c82d223f36eb9d64e2241d82f0a402cb42a53ac6643e668a",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.027
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "搜寻没有结果，警方判断，所谓自杀只是伪装。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "847ddc3ab4f79352ef6548e767229b655abd894947c7bea5ac61f13b2ac27969",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.329
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "他辗转各地，时而自称教授，用体面外表赢得信任。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "20d525e164bb959ec6690f8a4673402668dfb9b08c82ff6a18a334c0974b4c43",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.712
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "后来他又冒充律师，继续以虚假的身份行骗。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "bd78aae4088ff0f7759c8d64f0986bcbf9fd61dc061a353140a4f5e8e1f453e0",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.005
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "从神户到京都、名古屋，他不断更换衣着和说辞。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "9e935f3be3c687bf3c2cb960e0eff05b07f9dd336dd028084bce289ac200c59b",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.027
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "据公开资料，他诈骗所得合计约八十万日元。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "94ecabf54a136a92adb69f7b18aab6ca0b91fc705e2c25803c8a22d6ddcf5ad1",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.201
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十一月，静冈滨松一家旅馆的经营者母女遇害。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "53edf1114b6fc7b1c6054cbf6bbbe291524d3dfac7e983be1893ce7447a4c540",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "两条生命消逝，旅馆里只剩下寂静。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "8f73117ccac48953345cd4b3c7a5be433752bfe367e83b45c78bed78ee977706",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.435
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "加上福冈的两人，遇害者一共是五人。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "89374274e1c59c3c6ee7cec130320daa9519bb4ac0f59f5c6555e311c0072f1e",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 3.541
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "一九六四年一月二日，他来到熊本玉名。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "81b23349dd99d5c2718fc49a350487c52d8d36e53ab7db407a3cf6129a8fdfbb",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.214
    }
  ]
}
